WEBVTT

00:00:01.088 --> 00:00:03.437
Raynal gave the auger three days.

00:00:03.437 --> 00:00:05.462
It still would not bore the timber.

00:00:05.462 --> 00:00:07.187
They turned to a boat already built,

00:00:07.187 --> 00:00:08.598
the Grafton’s dinghy.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:12.708
They raised her sides.

00:00:12.708 --> 00:00:15.533
On trial, a shift of weight
nearly tipped her over.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:16.858
Three could sail.

00:00:16.858 --> 00:00:18.774
Henry and George would have to stay.

